Package: econdatalibrary
Type: Package
Title: Client for the Econ Data Library
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Ahmed", "Elkassabgi", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "admin@econdatalibrary.com")
Description: Access free economic and financial time series from the Econ Data
    Library (econdatalibrary.com): a curated, continuously-growing catalogue drawn
    from international organizations, national statistical offices, central banks
    and research datasets, each served with its producer's licence, attribution and
    citation. Search the catalogue, download series as tidy data frames, and fetch
    one indicator across many geographies. Registration is free; catalogue search
    and metadata require no key.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
